{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":22,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":1,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":3020,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1735266,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":263956,"Name":"Bride2B2014","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263956.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1363634319,"LastPoster":{"Id":277737,"Name":"2015Bride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":8,"Preview":{"Id":1735266,"PostDate":1363634319,"PostContent":"Hi all,  \u00a0  My fiance and I have booked Sandos Playacar. \u00a0I have seen a few threads however they...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jen_v81@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"64.40.247.213","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357506232,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263956.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bride2B2014","Id":263956,"Name":"Bride2B2014","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73262,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ec9e5c812ab4c97c633fce6a5a2df31","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Hi all,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;My fiance and I have booked Sandos Playacar. &amp;nbsp;I have seen a few threads however they are pretty old. &amp;nbsp;I am looking for new info and reviews on the Resort. &amp;nbsp;We are having out wedding on May 28, 2014 at 4:00PM. &amp;nbsp;Is that a good time? &amp;nbsp;Also looking for info regarding dinner on the beach vs. in a restaurant. &amp;nbsp;Also cocktail hour and more. &amp;nbsp;At this point any info is greatly appreciated. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363634030506_1611\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" style=\"line-height: 1.231;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1735266,"PostDate":1363634319,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Hi all,<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\">My fiance and I have booked Sandos Playacar. \u00a0I have seen a few threads however they are pretty old. \u00a0I am looking for new info and reviews on the Resort. \u00a0We are having out wedding on May 28, 2014 at 4:00PM. \u00a0Is that a good time? \u00a0Also looking for info regarding dinner on the beach vs. in a restaurant. \u00a0Also cocktail hour and more. \u00a0At this point any info is greatly appreciated. \u00a0<\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363634030506_1611\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" style=\"line-height: 1.231;\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jen_v81@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"64.40.247.213","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357506232,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263956.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bride2B2014","Id":263956,"Name":"Bride2B2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73262,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12be671a935d2fd38bd269b8a95b6d3b","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Bride2B2014[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [size=4]Hi all,[\/size] \n \n [size=4]My fiance and I have booked Sandos Playacar.  I have seen a few threads however they are pretty old.  I am looking for new info and reviews on the Resort.  We are having out wedding on May 28, 2014 at 4:00PM.  Is that a good time?  Also looking for info regarding dinner on the beach vs. in a restaurant.  Also cocktail hour and more.  At this point any info is greatly appreciated.  [\/size][img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif[\/img][\/quote] \n \n Hi Bride2B2, \n First, big congrats on the upcoming wedding and on choosing a destination! May is a good weather month in Playa del Carmen and it&#039;s nice to have the longer days of daylight savings time. It is a busy time in Playa too, so you may want to take that into consideration. Starting the ceremony a little later in the day (5:30) may help you avoid too many people around AND allow you to get some nice sunset shots. We shot a pretty wedding there with Bev and Jordan and they chose the gazebo over the beach and it was nice to have a little added intimacy\/privacy. The hotel should offer a champagne toast after the ceremony for your guests. Most all inclusives (like Sandos) have the receptions in the restaurant, though for a fee you could have them do a beach set up. I would also recommend setting a seating time of around 7:00 after a 5:30 ceremony to keep things moving along and active. \n \n Here are a few photos of weddings we have shot at Sandos Playacar. For the full slideshows, please click here for [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194400\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n Gazebo ceremony with Bev and Jordan \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194401\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n Beach ceremony with Melissa and Jason \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194402\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n Champagne and mariachis in the gazebo \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194405\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194403\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n Sunset couple portrait","Attachments":[],"Id":1735792,"PostDate":1363718903,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Bride2B2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Hi all,<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\">My fiance and I have booked Sandos Playacar. \u00a0I have seen a few threads however they are pretty old. \u00a0I am looking for new info and reviews on the Resort. \u00a0We are having out wedding on May 28, 2014 at 4:00PM. \u00a0Is that a good time? \u00a0Also looking for info regarding dinner on the beach vs. in a restaurant. \u00a0Also cocktail hour and more. \u00a0At this point any info is greatly appreciated. \u00a0<\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363634030506_1611\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" style=\"line-height: 1.231;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hi Bride2B2,<\/p> <p> First, big congrats on the upcoming wedding and on choosing a destination! May is a good weather month in Playa del Carmen and it's nice to have the longer days of daylight savings time. It is a busy time in Playa too, so you may want to take that into consideration. Starting the ceremony a little later in the day (5:30) may help you avoid too many people around AND allow you to get some nice sunset shots. We shot a pretty wedding there with Bev and Jordan and they chose the gazebo over the beach and it was nice to have a little added intimacy\/privacy. The hotel should offer a champagne toast after the ceremony for your guests. Most all inclusives (like Sandos) have the receptions in the restaurant, though for a fee you could have them do a beach set up. I would also recommend setting a seating time of around 7:00 after a 5:30 ceremony to keep things moving along and active.\u00a0<br \/> <br \/> Here are a few photos of weddings we have shot at Sandos Playacar. For the full slideshows, please click here for <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"CREATOR: gd-jpeg v1.0 (using IJG JPEG v62), quality = 90 \" data-id=\"194400\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194400\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> Gazebo ceremony with Bev and Jordan<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"CREATOR: gd-jpeg v1.0 (using IJG JPEG v62), quality = 90 \" data-id=\"194401\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194401\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> Beach ceremony with Melissa and Jason<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"CREATOR: gd-jpeg v1.0 (using IJG JPEG v62), quality = 90 \" data-id=\"194402\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194402\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> Champagne and mariachis in the gazebo<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1363716396113_2703\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"CREATOR: gd-jpeg v1.0 (using IJG JPEG v62), quality = 90 \" data-id=\"194405\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194405\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"CREATOR: gd-jpeg v1.0 (using IJG JPEG v62), quality = 90 \" data-id=\"194403\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/194403\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> Sunset couple portrait<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1175019240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73262,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e6746ec716a19db8260db71ce6e7ea1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Sandos Brides!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m new to this side and super excited to meet other 2014 Brides here. My fianc\u00a9 and I are having our wedding in June 2014.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Have you guys picked a Restaurant yet?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1762948,"PostDate":1370004741,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Sandos Brides!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm new to this side and super excited to meet other 2014 Brides here. My fianc\u00a9 and I are having our wedding in June 2014.<\/p> <p> Have you guys picked a Restaurant yet?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"felicitas.kinzzzzzzel@web.de","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369052761,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269765.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anon373737","Id":269765,"Name":"anon373737","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73262,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bcfa31c7ac9f1afb4d381d23ee0151e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;HI there, I am getting married on Jan 17, 2014. We have chosen the Italian buffet for dinner. I really wanted it to be private but the cost was too high for my 42 quests. We are though doing a private reception on the beach. How about you?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1804733,"PostDate":1380855436,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>HI there, I am getting married on Jan 17, 2014. We have chosen the Italian buffet for dinner. I really wanted it to be private but the cost was too high for my 42 quests. We are though doing a private reception on the beach. How about you?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"debirina@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380855351,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273994.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"debirina","Id":273994,"Name":"debirina","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73262,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b635f5ca42747de3d2dae92cded0902c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Sandos Brides&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;My fianc\u00a9 and I have booked the Sandos and getting married January 2014.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We have booked the Mediterranean A La Carte as the menu catered to our guests.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1808598,"PostDate":1382382242,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Sandos Brides<\/p> <p>My fianc\u00a9 and I have booked the Sandos and getting married January 2014.<\/p> <p>We have booked the Mediterranean A La Carte as the menu catered to our guests.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ncgood2001@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.168.34.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359569896,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265387.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NCGOOD","Id":265387,"Name":"NCGOOD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73262,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08e0ee2d14fe758b9dbc02907a940f3b","RawContent":"Hi everyone, I&#039;m so glad to see a new thread started! I&#039;m also getting married in January 2014, our date is January 20th what&#039;s your date??","Attachments":[],"Id":1808900,"PostDate":1382479353,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone, I'm so glad to see a new thread started! I'm also getting married in January 2014, our date is January 20th what's your date??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Jillian148@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1382476013,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274468.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jillvang","Id":274468,"Name":"Jillvang","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.168.34.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73262,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d26822d79e8cdc0dd3d49c5b19455c8a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are getting married January 13th at 4:30.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1818511,"PostDate":1386554263,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!<\/p>\n<p>We are getting married January 13th at 4:30.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ncgood2001@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.168.34.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359569896,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265387.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NCGOOD","Id":265387,"Name":"NCGOOD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.98.214.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73262,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f64a53f5f960dc89961ba5444bbf7bcd","RawContent":"Hello! What&#039;s the distance from Cancun&#039;s airport to Playa del Carmen?  \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\nHi Playacar brides! Do you mind sharing a breakdown of the wedding cost? We&#039;re plannning to get married March\/April 2015 and have no clue of how expensive is a destination wedding. ***Debirina, how expensive is your wedding going to be for 42 guests? Thank you!!! I&#039;m just dont know where to start! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1836123,"PostDate":1393685681,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello! What's the distance from Cancun's airport to Playa del Carmen?  <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<br \/>Hi Playacar brides! Do you mind sharing a breakdown of the wedding cost? We're plannning to get married March\/April 2015 and have no clue of how expensive is a destination wedding. ***Debirina, how expensive is your wedding going to be for 42 guests? Thank you!!! I'm just dont know where to start! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"calipso78@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.223.28.9","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362598029,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266979.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DianaSRZ","Id":266979,"Name":"DianaSRZ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.164.74.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73262,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a62da125290e158ddd667fb8adae0de6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"DianaSRZ\"] I think the travel time from the airport is 45minutes. at least thats what i&#039;ve read.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Im planning my wedding for January 2015, and so far SAndos playacar is my favourite option. Anyone have details or pictures&amp;nbsp; reception locations? Im planning on going with the package that includes the 3hour private dinner reception with DJ.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any reviews or details would be helpful!&amp;nbsp; THanks!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"NCGOOD\"] @[member=\"Jillvang\"]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1837109,"PostDate":1394195781,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"266979\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/266979-dianasrz\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DianaSRZ<\/span><\/a> I think the travel time from the airport is 45minutes. at least thats what i've read.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Im planning my wedding for January 2015, and so far SAndos playacar is my favourite option. Anyone have details or pictures\u00a0 reception locations? Im planning on going with the package that includes the 3hour private dinner reception with DJ.<\/p>\n<p>Any reviews or details would be helpful!\u00a0 THanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265387\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/265387-ncgood\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">NCGOOD<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274468\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/274468-jillvang\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jillvang<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.borges81@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"173.164.74.25","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390244252,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"aborgesbride","Id":276225,"Name":"aborgesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.164.74.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73262,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f9f9bb27d0d534bd3a58f2e3ae744278","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;HI @[member=\"Bride2B2014\"], i am actually starting to plan my wedding for January 2015, and Sandos Playacar is 1st on my list. How is your wedding planning going?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Im thiking about getting the package with the 3hr private dinner &amp;amp; DJ reception.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Curious about the reception locations? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has the wedding planner sent you over any details about that?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1837161,"PostDate":1394212479,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>HI @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"263956\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/263956-bride2b2014\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bride2B2014<\/span><\/a>, i am actually starting to plan my wedding for January 2015, and Sandos Playacar is 1st on my list. How is your wedding planning going?<\/p>\n<p>Im thiking about getting the package with the 3hr private dinner & DJ reception.<\/p>\n<p>Curious about the reception locations? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has the wedding planner sent you over any details about that?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.borges81@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"173.164.74.25","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390244252,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"aborgesbride","Id":276225,"Name":"aborgesbride","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"73262","Title":"2014 Sandos Playacar Brides","LastPostDate":1405290812},"Pages":{"TotalItems":22,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
